  "notes": "Implies skilled, confident use rather than basic use. Always positive — conveys mastery rather than mere utilization.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ～を{駆使|くし}する (make full use of ~)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {語学力|ごがくりょく}を{駆使|くし}する (make full use of language skills)\n- {技術|ぎじゅつ}を{駆使|くし}する (make full use of technology)\n- {知識|ちしき}を{駆使|くし}する (make full use of knowledge)\n- あらゆる{手段|しゅだん}を{駆使|くし}する (use every means available)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {使|つか}う is the neutral word for \"use\"\n- {活用|かつよう}する means to make practical use of\n- {駆使|くし}する implies mastery and full exploitation of one's abilities",
